OL,5,G0900 The Classic FM Hall of Fame Hour
OL,6,     FDan Walker brings you an hour of
OL,7,     Fthe biggest classical hits from
OL,8,     Fthe Classic FM Hall of Fame - the
OL,9,     Fannual Top 300 chart voted for by
OL,10,     Fyou.
OL,11,G1000 Aled Jones
OL,12,     FAled Jones presents three hours of
OL,13,     Fthe best classical music from late
OL,14,     Fmorning to lunchtime.
OL,15,G1300 Classic FM Requests
OL,16,     FJoin Anne-Marie Minhall for an
OL,17,     Fhour of your requests, followed by
OL,18,     Ftwo more hours of the very best
OL,19,     Fclassical music.
